  "title": "Baked Tofu Slices",
  "description": "Baked slices of tofu are topped with a mixture of soy sauce, chile-garlic sauce, Sriracha, and sesame seeds in this simple baked tofu recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "aLLASMN"
  ],
